Bebidas — Heizir F. de Castro (@ic-usp-beverages: 0, is #reference, #part-of @ic-sources) { r_6488KNYGN4C5BVD8HDZ914XCAF
Heizir Ferreira de Castro, Escola de Engenharia de Lorena, Universidade de São Paulo. Processos Químicos Industriais II, Bebidas, 2013. [Author/university full text](https://sistemas.eel.usp.br/docentes/arquivos/5840855/LOQ4023/Apostila3-Bebidas2013.pdf) · [Official teaching-material index](https://sistemas.eel.usp.br/docentes/visualizar.php?id=5840855).

Read the whole comparative beverage/fermentation process treatment, feed and biological transformations, separation and quality. Work its reaction/flow explanations and compare them with the substantial courses, technical books and independent quantities assigned in this subject. A concise apostila provides a Portuguese introduction rather than the entire advanced literature or operating knowledge.

The author, individual PDF title/year, contents and university-hosted access were checked on 29 October 2026. These public teaching notes retain copyright and component rights; free access is not represented as a blanket open licence. Historical data and external references keep their dates. The notes, slides, images and example data remain external links.

